{
  "openapi": "3.1.0",
  "info": {
    "title": "CF Meet Developer Platform internal API",
    "version": "1.2.0",
    "description": "HTTP surface of services/developer-platform: GET /health, GET /ready, the service-authenticated /internal/v1 API and (cfmeet.developer-platform.http-api) the gateway-forwarded customer API under /v1. Every /internal/v1 path, unknown ones included, requires a valid Ed25519 service token whose issuer the Developer Platform's trust bundle grants the route's permission. Customers never reach this service directly: the API Gateway authenticates them (Platform Access credentials, or the CF Meet session verified through the Meeting Service bridge) and forwards a signed request."
  },
